      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a7759be5acf6.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a774f186e3f8.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a774f183e56b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a774f18586a5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a774f18759e5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a774f1876c53.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixes and Fixes&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;if your &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;modifers&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;where &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;not being saved&lt;/span&gt; then Uninstall this &lt;a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/305388"&gt;99 Slot Mod&lt;/a&gt; and use the 99 Slot increase from &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;this mod update.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed the 1000 General Slot Increase not working for some&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Added actual Weapon Slot increases into the Mod&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed Modifiers not being saved (read text below)&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-wf="" class="_wordAnimating_yu34g_11"&gt;This &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-wf="" class="_wordAnimating_yu34g_11"&gt;mod &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-wf="" class="_wordAnimating_yu34g_11"&gt;brings &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-wf="" class="_wordAnimating_yu34g_11"&gt;patches &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-wf="" class="_wordAnimating_yu34g_11"&gt;that &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-wf="" class="_wordAnimating_yu34g_11"&gt;used &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-wf="" class="_wordAnimating_yu34g_11"&gt;to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-wf="" class="_wordAnimating_yu34g_11"&gt;only &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-wf="" class="_wordAnimating_yu34g_11"&gt;work &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-wf="" c