p.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Increase General Item Limit&lt;/span&gt;, this is the new one i added which changes the overall general item limit from &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;420&lt;/span&gt; to &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;1000&lt;/span&gt;, with that you can use More Weapon Slots and also Armor Limit+ without having items disappear from your inventory when overgoing that invisible limit. &lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;But know that once you uninstall this General Item Limit that your whole inventory will be Deleted.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;br&gt;I just made those patches cause i wanted to play through &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;relics&lt;/span&gt; again but without those limitations, so now everyone else can too.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inside the Install folder you can choose between installing only one of those, or the multi patch that has all of them, and then you can choose if you want the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;1.6&lt;/span&gt; one or the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;1.9&lt;/span&gt; one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Just Make sure you install it correctly that you install the UKMM file if you use the Multi Patch, and manually put the .pchtxt into the &lt;u&gt;switch/ipswitch&lt;/u&gt; folder and use &lt;a href="https://github.com/3096/ipswitch" target="_blank"&gt;ipswitch&lt;/a&gt; and convert it into a .ips, and that you put the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;subsdk4&lt;/span&gt; file manually into &lt;u&gt;01007EF00011E000/exefs&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;if you are on emulator then both the .pchtxt and subsdk4 go into &lt;u&gt;01007EF00011E000/mod/exefs&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;only thing i cant seem to fix is that more weapon slots still doesn't show arrows in the menu while still swappable with quick menu.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If there's any other problems after installing correctly just add me on discord "catzy3979".&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;H